    plot.innerHTML=`<line x1="10" y1="${Y(0)}" x2="150" y2="${Y(0)}" stroke="#c3cfd8"/><line x1="${X(0)}" y1="6" x2="${X(0)}" y2="68" stroke="#c3cfd8"/><polyline points="${points.join(" ")}" fill="none" stroke="${conceptPalette.ink}" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="${X(xc)}" cy="${Y(f(xc))}" r="4" fill="${colour}" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5"/><text x="6" y="12" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="${conceptPalette.muted}">${name}: f(${fmt(raw,2)}) = ${fmt(f(raw),2)}${off?" · off scale":""}</text>`;
